---
// Hero — brief §5 Home.Hero + STAAS_SITE_COPY.md §Home.Hero
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-cream">
  <!-- Decorative blobs -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -top-24 -right-32 w-[480px] h-[480px] rounded-full opacity-60"
    style="background: #F8DA8A; filter: blur(80px);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute top-40 -left-24 w-[320px] h-[320px] rounded-full opacity-50"
    style="background: #F4C4DC; filter: blur(64px);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6 pt-28 pb-24 md:pt-36 md:pb-32">
    <!-- Eyebrow -->
    <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-coral mb-6">
      Startup as a Service
    </p>

    <!-- H1 -->
    <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-7xl text-navy leading-[1.05] tracking-tight max-w-3xl mb-6">
      Experts have never been<br />
      this <em class="not-italic text-coral">affordable.</em>
    </h1>

    <!-- Subhead -->
    <p class="text-xl text-navy-muted max-w-xl mb-3 leading-relaxed">
      A senior product and engineering team, on subscription — for the build that comes after the demo.
    </p>

    <!-- Body line -->
    <p class="text-base text-navy-muted max-w-xl mb-10 leading-relaxed">
      The team you call when AI got you to a prototype, but you need a real product.
    </p>

    <!-- CTAs -->
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
      <a
        href="#pricing"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 rounded bg-navy text-cream text-sm font-medium hover:bg-navy-deep transition-colors"
      >
        See pricing
      </a>
      <a
        href="/workshop"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-3.5 rounded bg-coral text-cream text-sm font-medium hover:bg-coral-deep transition-colors"
      >
        Book the workshop
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
